gOX(){return"Indirect Resource"},
gOP(){return"Direct Resource"},
gOM(){return"The day master's own element and polarity \u2014 an equal. It reads as siblings, peers and rivals of one's own rank, and as self-reliance. It supports a weak day master and crowds a strong one."},
gP1(){return"The same element, opposite polarity \u2014 a peer who competes rather than assists. It shares the day master's strength and its wealth, so it reads as partnership and as rivalry in the same breath."},
gOU(){return"What the day master produces, same polarity \u2014 expression that flows without strain. Traditionally the star of appetite, craft and contentment: talent given out easily."},
gOW(){return"What the day master produces, opposite polarity \u2014 expression with an edge. Brilliant and unruly; it makes performers and critics, and it wears against the Direct Officer, which is authority."},
gP_(){return"What the day master controls, same polarity \u2014 wealth arriving irregularly. Opportunity, enterprise and windfall rather than salary; traditionally also the father, and an open hand with money."},
gOS(){return"What the day master controls, opposite polarity \u2014 wealth held steadily. Salary, property and careful management. In a man's chart it traditionally stands for the wife as well."},
gP3(){return"What controls the day master, same polarity \u2014 pressure with no cushion. Force, risk and decisive action: well handled it is courage, badly handled it is being driven."},
gOO(){return"What controls the day master, opposite polarity \u2014 authority one accepts. Office, rules, reputation and duty. In a woman's chart it traditionally stands for the husband as well."},
gOY(){return"What produces the day master, same polarity \u2014 support given unevenly. Intuition, unusual learning and a mind that goes its own way; traditionally it can also starve the Eating God."},
gOQ(){return"What produces the day master, opposite polarity \u2014 support given steadily. Education, protection and backing; traditionally the mother. It strengthens the day master and softens the pressure on it."},
gPU(){return"Peach Blossom"},
gPR(){return"Nobleman"},
gPX(){return"Travelling Horse"},
gPI(){return"Academic"},
gPL(){return"Canopy"},
gPO(){return"General"},
